window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/comm-v28-090-d2bf2009ae87ceab.json"]={sha256:"d2bf2009ae87ceab0c19c603a1e55fc6babdee6c39c85db87b38c412bdc1220f",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v28-case-54c0b2f5304c0c3c","url":"https://www.itu.int/epublications/publication/recommendation-itu-r-m-2012-7-02-2026-detailed-specifications-of-the-terrestrial-radio-interfaces-of-international-mobile-telecommunications-advanced-imt-advanced","title":"ITU-R M.2012-7: LTE-Advanced radio-interface specification","titleEn":"ITU-R M.2012-7: LTE-Advanced radio-interface specification","publisher":"ITU","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-090","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-090","related":[{"id":"comm-v28-091","referenceUrls":["https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/138200_138299/138211/19.02.00_60/ts_138211v190200p.pdf"],"title":"5G NR Numerology：子載波間距與時槽時間","titleEn":"5G NR numerology: subcarrier spacing and slot duration","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付物能重現 10.9 mW 與 2.98 mW，保留失敗情境且每個通過判定有明確門檻；需分開列出模型未涵蓋的實際系統驗證。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: The artifacts must reproduce 10.9 mW and 2.98 mW, preserve failing scenarios and attach a threshold to each pass decision; list actual-system validation outside this model separately.","difference":"能推導並解釋500 microsecond與125 microsecond，建立nr_slots.csv、時間格線、端到端延遲分解，並完成以下驗收：250 microsecond的時槽預算只由mu=3滿足；仍須單獨驗處理、排隊及重傳。","differenceEn":"Derive and explain 500 microsecond and 125 microsecond; create nr_slots.csv, timing grid and end-to-end delay decomposition; apply this acceptance decision: Only mu=3 fits a250 microsecond slot budget; processing, queueing and retries require separate verification.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["從原理 週期性喚醒的平均功率是狀態功率按時間加權；均勻到達時等待平均約睡眠窗口一半，非零延遲。 展開基準式 100*0.1+1*0.9；逐步記錄中間量與單位，先手算再用計算器或Python重算。接著用不同表示法交叉檢查：將一週期能量除以週期長度重算；另列最大等待900與980 ms，不將節能等同即時性。 將兩條推導一起存入 drx_states.csv、能量積分、最壞等待條件。","從原理 正常CP之NR時槽時間依2^mu縮放；提高子載波間距縮短時槽，但不單獨保證端到端低延遲。 展開基準式 1000/2**1；逐步記錄中間量與單位，先手算再用計算器或Python重算。接著用不同表示法交叉檢查：每1 ms時間窗分別應放2與8個時槽；計數與時間乘積必須回到1000 microsecond。 將兩條推導一起存入 nr_slots.csv、時間格線、端到端延遲分解。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Starting from Periodic wake power is time-weighted state power; uniformly arriving traffic waits roughly half the sleep interval rather than zero time., expand baseline expression 100*0.1+1*0.9; record intermediate values and units, calculate manually, then repeat with a calculator or Python. Use this independent representation: Divide per-cycle energy by cycle duration; separately record maximum waits900/980 ms rather than equating savings with immediacy. Save both derivations with drx_states.csv, energy integration and worst-wait criteria.","Starting from For normal-CP NR, slot duration scales with2^mu; larger subcarrier spacing shortens slots but does not alone guarantee low end-to-end latency., expand baseline expression 1000/2**1; record intermediate values and units, calculate manually, then repeat with a calculator or Python. Use this independent representation: A1 ms window contains2 or8 slots; slot count times duration must recover1000 microseconds. Save both derivations with nr_slots.csv, timing grid and end-to-end delay decomposition.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"comm-v28-100","referenceUrls":["https://www.o-ran.org/specifications"],"title":"O-RAN Near-RT RIC：過期遙測的控制延遲","titleEn":"O-RAN Near-RT RIC: stale telemetry in a control loop","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付物能重現 10.9 mW 與 2.98 mW，保留失敗情境且每個通過判定有明確門檻；需分開列出模型未涵蓋的實際系統驗證。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: The artifacts must reproduce 10.9 mW and 2.98 mW, preserve failing scenarios and attach a threshold to each pass decision; list actual-system validation outside this model separately.","difference":"能推導並解釋50 ms與90 ms，建立ric_event_trace.csv、資料年齡直方圖、回退決策，並完成以下驗收：60 ms狀態年齡門檻下第二組須停用該次建議或回退；不是直接降低真實基地台功率。","differenceEn":"Derive and explain 50 ms and 90 ms; create ric_event_trace.csv, state-age histogram and fallback decisions; apply this acceptance decision: At a60 ms state-age limit, reject the second recommendation or fall back; do not alter a real base-station power setting.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["從原理 週期性喚醒的平均功率是狀態功率按時間加權；均勻到達時等待平均約睡眠窗口一半，非零延遲。 展開基準式 100*0.1+1*0.9；逐步記錄中間量與單位，先手算再用計算器或Python重算。接著用不同表示法交叉檢查：將一週期能量除以週期長度重算；另列最大等待900與980 ms，不將節能等同即時性。 將兩條推導一起存入 drx_states.csv、能量積分、最壞等待條件。","從原理 控制動作使用的狀態年齡包含採樣、傳送、決策及施作延遲；高頻輸出不代表輸入新鮮。 展開基準式 20+10+15+5；逐步記錄中間量與單位，先手算再用計算器或Python重算。接著用不同表示法交叉檢查：以measurement_id、event_time、receive_time、action_time串接；排除重複樣本後計年齡。 將兩條推導一起存入 ric_event_trace.csv、資料年齡直方圖、回退決策。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Starting from Periodic wake power is time-weighted state power; uniformly arriving traffic waits roughly half the sleep interval rather than zero time., expand baseline expression 100*0.1+1*0.9; record intermediate values and units, calculate manually, then repeat with a calculator or Python. Use this independent representation: Divide per-cycle energy by cycle duration; separately record maximum waits900/980 ms rather than equating savings with immediacy. Save both derivations with drx_states.csv, energy integration and worst-wait criteria.","Starting from State age at actuation includes sampling, transport, decision and actuation delay; frequent outputs do not guarantee fresh inputs., expand baseline expression 20+10+15+5; record intermediate values and units, calculate manually, then repeat with a calculator or Python. Use this independent representation: Join measurement_id, event_time, receive_time and action_time, deduplicate, then compute state age. Save both derivations with ric_event_trace.csv, state-age histogram and fallback decisions.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v28-case-0e90e3978e42dfde","url":"https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/138200_138299/138211/19.02.00_60/ts_138211v190200p.pdf","title":"ETSI TS 138 211 V19.2.0: NR physical channels and modulation","titleEn":"ETSI TS 138 211 V19.2.0: NR physical channels and modulation","publisher":"ETSI / 3GPP","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v28-case-b4eac19943d342be","url":"https://www.o-ran.org/specifications","title":"O-RAN public specifications","titleEn":"O-RAN public specifications","publisher":"O-RAN ALLIANCE","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
